# make tablet-smoke (W22-S04, S05): go.img with QEMU's virtio tablet. A button
# press goes to the active pointer, the tablet once its driver is ready:
# the driver logs the first event it is handed.
wait burrow>
press left
release left
wait first event
# S05: paint follows /dev/input/event2. Wherever the pointer was, abs puts
# it on exact pixels: the red swatch (96,32), clicked; then a drag along
# y=400 from x=150 to x=650 in absolute steps.
screen 1024 768
type run /bin/paint
key ret
wait paint: ready
abs 900 700
abs 96 32
click left
abs 150 400
press left
abs 275 400
abs 400 400
abs 525 400
abs 650 400
release left
sleep 1
screendump build/screen-tablet-paint.ppm
key esc
wait paint: 1 strokes, last colour ff0000
wait burrow>
type poweroff
key ret
